==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|söugen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|sougen}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*saugijan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*saugijaną|t=to cause to suck, nourish}}, causative of {{der|de|gem-pro|*sūganą|t=to suck}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|sōgian|t=to suckle}}, modern {{cog|nds-de|sögen|t=to suckle}}. Related to {{cog|de|saugen|t=to suck}}.

